      "label": "Antisemitic Stereotype: 'Jews Only Live Once'",
      "description": "This is a derogatory antisemitic trope that falsely implies Jewish people are only meant to live one life, often used to dehumanize and marginalize Jewish individuals. It is rooted in historical antisemitic conspiracy theories and has been used to justify persecution and violence against Jewish communities. The phrase is a harmful stereotype that reduces Jewish existence to a fleeting, expendable moment, and is directly linked to antisemitic hate speech.",
